      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-91"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「像普通的女孩子一样生活]@[textBlack:像普通的女性一样一边生活一边建立起家庭]@[textBlack:生下孩子，将其养育成人]@[textBlack:然后变成老婆婆，被满堂儿孙包围着死去」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "motion": 300,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-92"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「虽然这么说，但我不仅]@[textBlack:从成为了魔法少女的瞬间开始就一直在背道而驰]@[textBlack:现在就连想要顺着前进的轨道都无法看清了]@[textBlack:所以只感到无比空虚而已」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_001.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "motion": 100,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-93"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「不过，我没有放弃。]@[textBlack:正因如此，我才会作为神滨魔法联盟的一员]@[textBlack:为了扩展自动净化系统而尽心竭力」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-94"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「虽然没有被选为战斗成员]@[textBlack:让我稍微有些悲伤…」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_001.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "motion": 200,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-95"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「但是，我可不能变得这么消极]@[textBlack:因为作为年长者，我必须]@[textBlack:尽量不制造出让周围的人消沉的气氛」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "motion": 1,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-96"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「虽然刚才说了些稍微有点消极的话]@[textBlack:但是说实话，对于现在的状况]@[textBlack:我的态度并没有那么消极向下」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "id": 100601,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-97"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「让大家不再变成魔女]@[textBlack:这条能得到救赎的希望之路还依然健在」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-98"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「而且，灯花要求我考上大学这件事也是]@[textBlack:比起对父母言听计从，继承水名的和服铺]@[textBlack:这样应该能让我走在一条]@[textBlack:更接近普通的女孩子的道路上」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
            "id": 100601,
            "motion": 0,
            "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102704/vo_full_102704-24-99"
          }
        ],
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:「而且，和那个制造了]@[textBlack:让我加入Magius之翼的相亲对象]@[textBlack:我还姑且保持着联系」]"
      },
      {
        "chara": [
